{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-5-25","kind":"proposition","title":"大小比较：比例","englishTitle":"If four magnitudes be proportional, the greatest and the least are greater than the remaining two.","book":5,"number":25,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.25","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.25/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":25,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-5-25@raw-b990cfed5884eee0","contentId":"euclid-5-25","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b990cfed5884eee0f9e70bf4a936f3c515e3c62e8565dd9e76053abc02bb580a","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-5-25.statement","euclid-5-25.construction.1","euclid-5-25.construction.2","euclid-5-25.proof.1","euclid-5-25.proof.2","euclid-5-25.proof.3","euclid-5-25.proof.4","euclid-5-25.proof.5","euclid-5-25.conclusion","euclid-5-25.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-5-25.statement","contentId":"euclid-5-25","revisionId":"euclid-5-25@raw-b990cfed5884eee0","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2ecc9c025961cb1aadf582742cd94e1f82a53e94177529476460b5cbe11443b3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If four magnitudes be proportional, the greatest and the least are greater than the remaining two."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果四级是成比例,最大和最小的比其余两个大。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-25.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-5-25","revisionId":"euclid-5-25@raw-b990cfed5884eee0","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"14a4e763c6de87ae155e41383125d1262a990e97e4dca46722858093931f2acf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the four magnitudes AB, CD, E, F be proportional so that, as AB is to CD, so is E to F, and let AB be the greatest of them and F the least; I say that AB, F are greater than CD, E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让4级AB、CD、E、F等为成比例,AB至CD等之比等于E至F之比,AB等之比最大,F等之最小;我说,AB、F等大于CD、E；AB 与 CD 之比等于 E 与 F 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-25.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-5-25","revisionId":"euclid-5-25@raw-b990cfed5884eee0","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3240c101175f325346faf3c39372e885d078d5566900b90c66877082134caf77","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let AG be made equal to E, and CH equal to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AG等于E,CH等于F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-25.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-5-25","revisionId":"euclid-5-25@raw-b990cfed5884eee0","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5b2f23193ab74ec53c774c4632965962d7356687ff6a3acf33c1fa4643ece8cb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since, as AB is to CD, so is E to F, and E is equal to AG, and F to CH, therefore, as AB is to CD, so is AG to CH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于AB对CD的比等于E对F的比,E对AG的比等于AG,F对CH的比等于AG对CH的比；AB 与 CD 之比等于 E 与 F 之比；AB 与 CD 之比等于 AG 与 CH 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-25.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-5-25","revisionId":"euclid-5-25@raw-b990cfed5884eee0","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3aa71d40d29b0763dc24191a139a150fa928a102a0a447e81a6efb4a6345a1fd","citations":["euclid-5-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since, as the whole AB is to the whole CD, so is the part AG subtracted to the part CH subtracted, the remainder GB will also be to the remainder HD as the whole AB is to the whole CD. [[V. 19](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于整个AB和CD的比例等于部分AG的比例,减去部分CH,其余GB也将等于其余HD,因为整个AB与全部CD。 [[V. 19](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-25.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-5-25","revisionId":"euclid-5-25@raw-b990cfed5884eee0","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4a1ececfe3b88ae2a10062b53a1d986c69567e3f38705a0ab4f45458b86fe42c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AB is greater than CD; therefore GB is also greater than HD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AB超过CD,因此GB也超过HD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-25.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-5-25","revisionId":"euclid-5-25@raw-b990cfed5884eee0","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0edcb80b2a9c706dd17257795ea088967a0e5f615c120ba7633acd94ffa914c2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AG is equal to E, and CH to F, therefore AG, F are equal to CH, E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AG等于E,CH等于F,AG等于CH,E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-25.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-5-25","revisionId":"euclid-5-25@raw-b990cfed5884eee0","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cbdfbdf1a8ba12eef610e1a3b886176406f554c1bbab4d50495bc8a9fe4517dd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And if, GB, HD being unequal, and GB greater, AG, F be added to GB and CH, E be added to HD, it follows that AB, F are greater than CD, E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果GB,HD是不平等的,GB以上,AG,F被加到GB,CH被加到HD,E被加到AB,F超过CD,E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-25.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-5-25","revisionId":"euclid-5-25@raw-b990cfed5884eee0","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-25.source","contentId":"euclid-5-25","revisionId":"euclid-5-25@raw-b990cfed5884eee0","order":9,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ca4d99fdc6043ffb1ae31355a91677afcd7bd574448085ad49bb089c33775692","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.25/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.25\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-5-25:euclid-5-19:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-25","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-25.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-19","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.25","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.25/","sourceLabel":"V. 19"}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-5-25:euclid-5-19:explicit","id":"euclid-5-19","book":5,"number":19,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：比例论","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-ratio","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
